        "v": "One planned order plays two roles: it is supply on the parent's plan and demand on the component's, and the component's own plan has already answered it. Planned quantities equal the raw shortfall only when the item's ordering data imposes no lot-size rule; a minimum or a multiple changes the number before you see it."
